<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rises to 7.61 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rises to 7.61 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 7.61 percent on Saturday from 7.55 percent on Thursday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded on the market in twelve reported transactions with a total value of 10.9 million dinars ($15 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar --Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
